service_integrations.description:
Application service credential integrations in the same shape returned by repository scan and accepted by the Aiven API. Each source_service must already exist in the project. Inspect the application source and explicitly set each user_config.exposed_values.<value>.environment_variable_key; this MCP supplies no defaults.

Example:
  service_integrations: [
    { integration_type: "application_service_credential", source_service: "my-pg", user_config: { service_type: "pg", exposed_values: { connection_string: { environment_variable_key: "DATABASE_URL" } } } }
  ]
